{"org":"bazelbuild","repo":"bazel","prNumber":"22559","commit":"7cfb5c924d00fc847ac748b9e41ec7dd3c8537d8","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The field `private final Label targetLabel` (in #T66X8) and the constructor parameter (in #DSEPJ) are not annotated `@Nullable`, yet `Spawn.getTargetLabel()` is explicitly `@Nullable` (as shown in the dependency), and the tests (#D3TC6, #V86WK) pass `null`. This will either cause a `NullPointerException` at runtime when the label is genuinely absent, or silently violate the non-null contract. The field and parameter should be annotated `@Nullable` to match the source.","nodes":[{"id":"src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java-src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java--2448:2465,2852:2883","promptId":"#DSEPJ","srcPath":"src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java","dstPath":"src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2448,"endPos":2465,"startLine":64,"startLineOffset":6,"endLine":64,"endLineOffset":23,"length":18},{"pos":2852,"endPos":2883,"startLine":79,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":79,"endLineOffset":35,"length":32}]},{"id":"src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java-src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java--1876:1908","promptId":"#T66X8","srcPath":"src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java","dstPath":"src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawn.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":1876,"endPos":1908,"startLine":47,"startLineOffset":2,"endLine":47,"endLineOffset":34,"length":33}]},{"id":"src/test/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawnTest.java-src/test/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/sandbox/SymlinkedSandboxedSpawnTest.java--3396:3414,3415:3419","promptI